During the bundling process, Bun maps the implicit private fields of both classes to a single, shared module-scoped WeakMap variable (e.g., var _myData = new WeakMap;). Because of this naming collision, the WeakMap initialization for ComponentB completely overwrites the WeakMap for ComponentA.
