## Summary

Running `bun test` against a suite where multiple test files each import `@techstark/opencv-js` (Emscripten) **and** the project transitively depends on `@napi-rs/canvas@1.0.0` causes a hard segfault (`Segmentation fault at address 0x1A`) shortly after Bun begins collecting test files.

The same suite ran cleanly under `@napi-rs/canvas@0.1.x` (a benign Emscripten/embind warning was produced but tests completed). Running each test file individually under 1.0 also passes. The crash only appears when more than one file shares a single Bun process.

