The plain `TransformStream` backpressures in Bun, so this is specific to the compression streams.

Raising the cap shows there is no limit at all, and that the queued data is really held:

```
accepted 2048 chunks = 128 MB of incompressible input, nothing read | RSS 31 -> 166 MB
