Self-contained, no dependencies, no network. A hand-rolled HTTP/2 server (raw frames over TCP, so nghttp2 is not part of the test) stalls a stream on flow control, raises `SETTINGS_INITIAL_WINDOW_SIZE`, and checks whether the ACK arrives before the client starts using the new window.

```
