`String.prototype.replace` calls `RegExp.prototype[Symbol.replace]`. That function converts `replaceValue` to a string in step 6 of https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-regexp.prototype-%25symbol.replace%25. It reads `flags` in step 7 and calls `exec` in step 12. So an `exec` that the `toString` installs must run.

