### Additional information

Found while building a crawler on `Bun.WebView`. It is not only a race a caller can avoid by serialising their own calls: the page can start the navigation itself, through a redirect, a form submit, or a script that sets `location`, while an `evaluate()` is running. In those cases no amount of care on the caller's side prevents it, so any long-lived view eventually wedges.

