|---|---|
| Bun main a4f1429148 (release build, Linux x64, kernel 7.0.0) | `100000 'error' events; setImmediate ran 0 times; the 1 ms timer fired: false` |
| Node v26.3.0 | `200 loop turns; 199 'error' events; the 1 ms timer fired: true` |

