### What steps can reproduce the bug?

`process.hrtime.bigint()` (and `process.hrtime()`) inside a `Worker` counts from that worker's own start rather than from the origin the main thread uses. So readings taken in different threads of one process can't be compared. In Node, every thread reads the same monotonic clock.

`hrtime-worker.mjs`:

```js
