### Additional information

Same shape as #44639 (`filter`, fixed in #44648): none of the four is a typed property. The original port stubbed them, `svg.rs` as empty enums (`pub enum StrokeLinecap {}`, ...) and `ui.rs`'s `Caret` / `CaretShape` / `ColorOrAuto` as placeholders, and #31254 / #33925 later removed the stubs as dead code. `FallbackHandler` still lists all four under "not implemented yet" ([`prefix_handler.rs`](https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/bbdc5a519e0a06d1b3133b564f91096b9ba10a31/src/css/properties/prefix_handler.rs#L12-L18)). They go through as unparsed token lists, which get no color fallbacks.

lightningcss implements them as `fill` / `stroke`: `SVGPaint` (`properties/svg.rs`), `caret-color`: `ColorOrAuto` and `caret`: `Caret` (`properties/ui.rs`), all four in `define_fallbacks!`. #44648 adds the prefixed branch of that handler for `filter`; these four are unprefixed, so they'd use the existing `handle_unprefixed!` arm next to `color` and `text-shadow`.

