### Expected

- `blob:`: the [scheme fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#scheme-fetch) steps return a network error when the method is not `GET`. WPT `fetch/api/basic/scheme-blob.sub.any.js` tests POST, OPTIONS, HEAD, PUT, DELETE and an invalid method.
- `HEAD`: [main fetch](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#main-fetch) sets the body of the response to null for a `HEAD` request, so `data:` (and `file:`) with `HEAD` has no body.
- `file:` is left to the implementation. A method that changes a resource (`POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE`) should not be answered as a read.

