### What steps can reproduce the bug?

`Bun.serve` request bodies larger than 256 KiB are reallocated and copied several times while they are buffered, even when `Content-Length` is known. With 2.4 MB bodies, `perf` attributes **21.5% of the server's main thread to `finish_grow`** (realloc + `memmove` of the partially received body).

`server.ts`:

```ts
Bun.serve({
  port: 3999,
  async fetch(req) {
    const body = await req.arrayBuffer();
    return new Response(String(body.byteLength));
  },
});
```

`client.ts` (16 concurrent POSTs of 2.4 MB with `Content-Length`):

```ts
const body = new Uint8Array(2_400_000).fill(65);
const end = performance.now() + 8000;
await Promise.all(Array.from({ length: 16 }, async () => {
  while (performance.now() < end)
    await (await fetch("http://127.0.0.1:3999/", { method: "POST", body })).text();
}));
```

Profile of the server's main thread (`perf record -e cpu-clock -F 999 --call-graph fp -t <pid>` on the matching `bun-linux-x64-profile` build, symbolised from its symbol table):

```
on_data::handle                         52.1% (cumulative)
  __x64_sys_recvfrom / tcp_recvmsg      44.9%
  finish_grow → __memmove                21.5%
    via reserve_exact                     65% of that  (final chunk, RequestContext.rs:4279)
    via do_reserve_and_handle             35% of that  (extend_from_slice doubling, :4309)
```

```
__memmove_avx512_unaligned_erms
::finish_grow
::reserve_exact            (or ::reserve::do_reserve_and_handle)
::on_data::handle          (on_buffered_body_chunk, inlined)
uWS::HttpParser::consumePostPadded
uWS::HttpContext::onData
us_internal_dispatch_ready_poll
us_loop_run_bun_tick
```

The cause appears to be in [`on_buffered_body_chunk`](https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/f7607a3d350b9c9488d41eab6a18d6cac74794e6/src/runtime/server/RequestContext.rs#L4297-L4310): the first chunk reserves `min(Content-Length, MAX_REQUEST_BODY_PREALLOCATE_LENGTH)`, and [`MAX_REQUEST_BODY_PREALLOCATE_LENGTH` is 256 KiB](https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/f7607a3d350b9c9488d41eab6a18d6cac74794e6/src/runtime/server/RequestContext.rs#L4513). Past that, `extend_from_slice` grows the `Vec` by doubling (512 KiB → 1 MiB → 2 MiB → 4 MiB), and the last chunk's [`reserve_exact(total)`](https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/blob/f7607a3d350b9c9488d41eab6a18d6cac74794
